That's the hardest part, isn't it?

352
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:30,000
当你意识到你无法阻止这个世界伤害他们
When you realize you can't stop the world from hurting them.

353
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:32,860
你说得我好想哭
Now you're making me want to cry.

354
00:13:33,940 --> 00:13:35,920
今天不该这样的
This is not what this day is all about.

355
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:36,400
你说得对
You're right.

356
00:13:37,460 --> 00:13:37,940
好
Okay.

357
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:39,540
我去给我们拿点香槟来
I'll go and get us some champagne.

358
00:13:39,820 --> 00:13:40,640
好主意
Good idea.

359
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:47,100
曼尼
Manny?

360
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,180
不 没事
No, nothing.

361
00:13:49,860 --> 00:13:51,720
我就是想问问你还好吗
Just wanted to know if everything is okay.

362
00:13:52,760 --> 00:13:54,120
喂 乖女儿 抱歉打扰你
Hi, honey. Sorry to bother you.

363
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:55,040
我知道你在休息
I know you're resting.

364
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,300
我听说你昨晚晕倒了
I heard you had a little scare last night.

365
00:13:58,075 --> 00:14:00,640
你什么时候再去看医生
Hey, uh, when are you going back to the doctor?

366
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:02,512
如果你愿意 我可以陪你一起去
'cause if you want, I can go with you.

367
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:14,000
今年的情人节
This year for Valentine's Day,

368
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,940
我们决定给所有的单身朋友
we decided to throw a lonely hearts party

369
00:14:15,940 --> 00:14:17,360
办场"孤心派对"
for all of our single friends.

370
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:18,880
有时在他们周围
Sometimes when we're around them,

371
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:21,420
我们会为自己找到了真命天子而内疚
we feel a little guilty for having found each other,

372
00:14:21,500 --> 00:14:23,820
就好像我们对着他们的脸甩幸福似的
like we're waving our love in their faces.

373
00:14:24,472 --> 00:14:26,960
你非要说得让人想歪吗
There's gotta be a better way of saying that.

374
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,720
总之 我们本来打算办场高雅的派对
Anyway, it was supposed to be an elegant affair.

375
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:31,380
瞧我的媚眼
Ogle me.

376
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,600
好戏要开始咯 把猫拿走
Showtime. Put the cat away.

377
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,299
好的 好的
Okay. Yeah. Great.

378
00:14:34,299 --> 00:14:36,540
-对了 米奇尔 -怎么了
- Oh, and, Mitchell, please... Hey. - Yeah?

379
00:14:36,540 --> 00:14:37,880
今晚你要放开了好好玩儿
Please try to have fun tonight.

380
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:38,780
我一直都很放得开啊
I always have fun.

381
00:14:38,780 --> 00:14:41,028
不 我知道你很擅长宅在家里玩儿
No, I know you're great at stay-at-home fun

382
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,040
或是窝在沙发里玩儿
and sit-on-the-couch fun,

383
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,800
但这是派对狂欢 而你有时...
but this is party fun, and sometimes you--

384
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:44,780
行了 这样可不好玩
Okay, this is not fun.

385
00:14:45,040 --> 00:14:45,880
去开门
Get the door.

386
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:49,100
让小哥我放开玩给你看
I will show you some fun.

387
00:14:53,300 --> 00:14:56,420
那之后的事情就有点记不清了
Things got a little hazy after that.

388
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,120
喂
Hello?

389
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,480
爸 你好
Yeah, hi--hi, dad.

390
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:09,160
不不 我起来了 起来了
No, no. I'm up. I am up.

391
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:10,680
好 送她过来吧 随时都行
Yeah, bring her by at any time.

392
00:15:11,380 --> 00:15:12,660
好 晚安
Okay. Good night.

393
00:15:13,380 --> 00:15:14,100
小卡
Oh, Cam.

394
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:17,000
天呐 昨晚还真是疯狂的派对啊
Oh, god, that was some party last night.

395
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,960
是啊 我很高兴你安全回来了
Yeah. Well, I'm just glad you made it home safely.

396
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:20,860
什么 回来 我不...
Wha--made--made it ho-- I don't--

397
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:22,880
我都不记得我离开过
I don't even remember leaving the party.

398
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:25,380
我好像是有点微醺
Oh, I-I think I got a little tipsy.

399
00:15:25,380 --> 00:15:25,780
微醺
Tipsy?

400
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,877
你比《广告狂人》里的人喝得都醉
You were like all of the "Mad Men."

401
00:15:28,091 --> 00:15:29,080
不 不 不
Oh, no, no, no.

402
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:31,720
别弄得就跟我有多疯狂 多失控似的
Don't make it out like I did a lot of crazy, out of control--

403
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,620
我以为那是我梦中的情景呢
I was hoping I dreamt that.

404
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:37,820
行啦 就跟你没有在喝高之后
Come on. Like--like you've never had a few cocktails

405
00:15:37,820 --> 00:15:39,500
用樱桃酒把猫染成粉色过似的
and died a cat pink with cherry Kool-Aid.

406
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:42,180
好吧 还有什么别的需要告诉我的吗
Okay. Well, is there anything else you need to tell me about?

407
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:43,460
我不记得有什么了
Not that I remember.

408
00:15:45,180 --> 00:15:46,440
现在记起这事了
I'm remembering this.

409
00:15:47,020 --> 00:15:48,120
天呐 米奇尔
Oh, my gosh, Mitchell,

410
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,800
那是伯特和道迪·温切尔家的
are these Burt and Dottie Winchell's

411
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,720
圣诞节装饰物吗 你怎么能这样
Christmas decorations? How could you?

412
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:53,640
他们到现在都没收起来
They never take them down, okay?

413
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:55,400
我这是给整个社区做了件好事
I was doing the whole neighborhood a favor.

414
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:56,980
天呐
Oh, god.

415
00:15:56,980 --> 00:16:00,281
小卡 我觉得...好像还拍了照片
Cam, I... You know, I think-- I-I think there are pictures.

416
00:16:00,281 --> 00:16:03,750
我记得胡娇和朗吉娜...好吧
I remember Pepper and Longinus were--okay.

417
00:16:03,940 --> 00:16:05,700
天呐 可怜的小驯鹿
Oh, my gosh. Those poor reindeer.

418
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:07,860
似乎"欢腾"才是派对之花啊
Oh, it seems like Prancer is the belle of the ball--

419
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:09,060
不出意料
No surprise there.

420
00:16:09,060 --> 00:16:11,100
你一定就是"悍妇"咯
Oh. You must be Vixen.

421
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,780
行了行了 这不好笑 米奇尔
Okay. Okay. Not funny, Mitchell.

422
00:16:12,820 --> 00:16:15,300
瞧瞧我们家 你脑子进水了吧
Look at this place. What were you thinking?

423
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:18,440
小卡 我 我是有点疯狂过度了
Okay. Cam, I... Yes, I went a little nuts, all right?

424
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,220
我很抱歉
I-I'm sorry.

425
00:16:19,220 --> 00:16:21,600
但我没做任何不能挽回的事啊
But I didn't do anything that can't be undone.

426
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:22,600
早啊室友们
Hey, roomies.

427
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:26,480
真的很感谢你们让我搬来住
Hey, thank you so much for letting me move in here.

428
00:16:29,059 --> 00:16:31,111
好 能让我们先单聊
Yes. Could you excuse us for just a...

429
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,820
一会儿吗 迪兰
a moment, Dylan?

430
00:16:32,940 --> 00:16:34,600
好 尽管聊别着急
Yeah. Take as much time as you need.

431
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,600
这是你们家 我只是住在这里而已
It's your house. I just live here now.

432
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:40,100
小卡 是我让他住进来的吗
Cam, did--did I tell him that he could live with us?

433
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,400
-显然啊 -天呐
- Obviously. - Oh, my god.

434
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:42,660
他参加我们的派对了吗
Was he even at our party?

435
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:45,260
是的 他在某个公司做豪华轿车司机
Yes. He's been driving a limousine for some company,

436
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:46,500
耶玛库斯昨晚雇了他
and J'marcus hired him for the night,

437
00:16:46,500 --> 00:16:48,160
现在他搬来这里住了 你想起来没有
and now he lives here. Are you all caught up there?

438
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,840
我一点都不记得了
I-I don't remember any of this.

439
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:50,920
那我们来创造新的记忆吧
Well, let's create a new memory--

440
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:53,380
你去告诉他 他不能住这里
One where you tell him he can't live here.

441
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,460
我能说句话吗
Can I say one short thing?

442
00:16:55,980 --> 00:16:58,340
昨晚来到这里时我心灰意冷
I came to this house a broken man

443
00:16:58,340 --> 00:17:00,740
我妈妈为了她的新男友把我赶出了家
after my mom threw me out for her new boyfriend.

444
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:01,980
后来我又发现
And then I found out

445
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:03,840
轿车公司要开除我
I was getting let go from the limo company

446
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:06,560
与此同时海莉又抛下我去参加派对
the same night Haley goes to a party without me.

447
00:17:06,880 --> 00:17:10,120
我一无所有 无依无靠
So I had nothing and no one.

448
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:12,420
而你们
And then you...

449
00:17:13,102 --> 00:17:13,680
赶紧的 告诉他
Okay. Come on. Tell him.

450
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,080
让他说完
Let him finish.

451
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:15,860
对不起
I'm sorry.

452
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:20,000
我知道 同性恋们总是对我很好
I mean, gay dudes have always been nice to me--

453
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:21,580
超级好
I mean, super nice.

454
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:23,460
但从没有像你们这样的
But nothing like this.

455
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:25,700
我想我要说的是
I guess what I'm trying to say is...

456
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:27,000
天呐 他要开唱了吗
Oh, my god. He's gonna sing.

457
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:31,740
*多年来 凄凄惨惨地活着*
*So many years living life underwater*

458
00:17:31,740 --> 00:17:36,040
*终于在 令媛的房间找到人间温暖*
*Came up for air in the room of your daughter*

459
00:17:36,421 --> 00:17:40,649
*我从未想过 我会在*
*I never knew I would find my answer*

460
00:17:40,649 --> 00:17:44,680
*前女友舅舅家里找到答案*
*In my ex-girlfriend's uncles' house*

461
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:49,640
*有一只小小的粉色美洲豹相伴*
*With the tiny pink panther*

462
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:51,688
迪兰 迪兰 打断下
Dylan, Dylan. I'm--I'm sorry.

463
00:17:51,698 --> 00:17:53,680
我的天 这真是
Oh, gosh, I--this is...

464
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:56,040
这真是太难说出口了
This is really hard for me to say,

465
00:17:56,040 --> 00:17:59,357
但我们不能
but we--we just cannot...

466
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:02,200
不去把猫洗一下
Not wash our cat.

467
00:18:02,840 --> 00:18:03,380
抱歉
I'm sorry.

468
00:18:05,860 --> 00:18:08,040
我喝醉了那样对它 它一下也没抓我
And yet when I did that drunk, not a scratch.

469
00:18:08,940 --> 00:18:11,520
我的天 比我们刚搬进来时还要干净
Oh, my gosh, this place is cleaner than when we moved in.

470
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,140
他是史上最好的房客
Best houseguest ever.

471
00:18:13,140 --> 00:18:14,700
不行 不能收留他
No, we are not keeping him.

472
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:17,900
你觉得他把圣诞装饰送回温切尔家了吗
Do you think he took the christmas decorations back to the Winchell's?

473
00:18:18,100 --> 00:18:19,700
我想他自以为这样做了
Oh, well, I think he thinks he did.

474
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:21,080
-什么 -是的
- What? - Okay, yeah.

475
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,040
-迪兰 -迪兰
- Dylan! - Dylan!

476
00:18:22,040 --> 00:18:23,220
-迪兰 -不 不要
- Dylan! - No, no, no!

477
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:24,880
伙计们 我在上面
Oh, hey, guys. I'm up here.

478
00:18:25,060 --> 00:18:26,620
是的 听着 迪兰
Yeah, hi. Listen, Dylan,

479
00:18:26,700 --> 00:18:28,720
那些装饰是放在院子里的
those decorations were on the yard...

480
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:29,940
那家的院子
Of that house.

481
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:32,700
这样啊 想做好事变坏事了
Oh. No good deed, huh?

482
00:18:34,484 --> 00:18:37,795
喂 从这里可以看到我们的家
Hey! I can see our house from here.

483
00:18:39,138 --> 00:18:41,240
-老天 开什么玩笑 -迪兰 迪兰
- Oh, jeez. Are you kidding me? - Dylan! Dylan!

484
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:41,760
今天什么鬼日子
This day...

485
00:18:42,800 --> 00:18:45,060
就住一晚 等他骨头稍微长好点
One night. Just till his bone sets.

486
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:47,580
但总会有各种理由让你不忍心对他开口
But there's always gonna be a reason not to tell him,

487
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:48,040
不是吗
isn't there?

488
00:18:48,040 --> 00:18:49,560
好吧 我们不如这样
Okay. What if we, um--

489
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,940
不行 不行 不行
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

490
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:53,327
没我什么事 你自己铺的烂摊子自己收拾[躺]
No "We." You made your bed. You lie in it.

491
00:18:53,620 --> 00:18:55,160
别躺在这里 我刚铺好
Don't lie there. I just made it.

492
00:18:55,420 --> 00:18:55,640
抱歉
Sorry.

493
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,900
我没看 我没看
Not looking. Not looking.

494
00:18:58,080 --> 00:18:58,960
进来吧 迪兰
It's okay, Dylan.

495
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:00,500
我给你们做了汤
I made you guys some soups.

496
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:02,180
迪兰 这么客气做什么
Oh, Dylan, you didn't have to do that.

497
00:19:02,320 --> 00:19:04,160
小卡也不用这么客气主动收留我
Well, Cam didn't have to offer to let me stay here,

498
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:04,800
但他这样做了
but he did.

499
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:06,800
好好喝汤吧
So here are soups.

500
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:08,000
小卡主动收留
Cam offered?

501
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:10,680
我知道他是代表你们两个人说的
Well, I know he was speaking for both of you.

502
00:19:10,940 --> 00:19:13,560
你当时还没回家 这样有问题吗
You weren't home yet. Is that a problem?

503
00:19:14,060 --> 00:19:15,200
我没问题
Not for me.

504
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:18,460
迪兰 你能让我们单独待会儿吗
Dylan, can you give us just a moment?

505
00:19:18,740 --> 00:19:20,780
我没看 我没看
Not looking. Not looking.

506
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:23,120
我去开
I'll get it!

507
00:19:23,620 --> 00:19:25,340
我想某种程度上
So I guess in a way,

508
00:19:25,340 --> 00:19:26,620
我们都有责任
we're both responsible.

509
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:29,260
是的 但仔细分析 责任是你的
Yeah, but in the real way, you're responsible.

510
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,900
快去搞定
Take care of that.

511
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,040
快去
Come on.

512
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,380
勇敢去吧
Let's do it.

513
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,300
我的天 我现在好恨我自己
Oh, my god. I hate myself right now.

514
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:37,240
什么样的禽兽
What kind of monster

515
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:39,220
会把受伤的无知小青年赶上大街
throws an injured innocent onto the street?

516
00:19:39,380 --> 00:19:41,260
你不能住在这里 快出去
You can't live here. Get out!

517
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:42,520
-莉莉 -莉莉
- Lily. - Lily.

518
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:44,420
这样很奇怪 你是个大男生
It's weird. You're a big boy.

519
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:46,060
-抱歉 迪兰 -她不是有心的
- I'm sorry, Dylan. - She doesn't mean that.

520
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:48,540
不 她是对的 大家都这样说
No. She's right. Everyone says it.

521
00:19:48,540 --> 00:19:50,580
我不能再逃避矛盾了
I need to stop running from conflict.

522
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:53,240
是时候做个勇敢的大男生 解决问题
It's time to be a big boy and patch things up

523
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:55,240
搬回我妈家去了
and move back in with my mom.

524
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:56,900
我去收拾东西
I'll get my things.

525
00:19:56,900 --> 00:19:59,478
-好吧 抱歉 -抱歉
- Okay. Sorry. - Sorry.

526
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,720
我这么容易就脱身了
I guess I got off easy.

527
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:05,980
她说话很直接却超级有效
She is blunt but effective.

528
00:20:06,040 --> 00:20:07,660
或许我们该派她去跟园丁谈谈
Maybe we should have her talk to the gardener.

529
00:20:07,951 --> 00:20:09,086
小卡
Cam, um...

530
00:20:09,220 --> 00:20:11,600
你真的觉得我这人很无趣吗
Do you really think that I'm not any fun?

531
00:20:11,820 --> 00:20:14,160
-什么 -昨晚你说我...
- What? - Last night, you said that I--

532
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,380
我家可不是酒店
This isn't a hotel!

533
00:20:15,380 --> 00:20:17,193
你已经说得很明白了 亲爱的
Yeah, you made your point, honey!

534
00:20:17,373 --> 00:20:18,402
他已经懂了
He's got it.

535
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:21,381
不 我昨晚那样狂喝
No, it--I only drank like that last night

536
00:20:21,381 --> 00:20:24,360
只是因为我想变得更有趣
because I... I was trying to be more fun.

537
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:26,700
不 我不是那个意思
Oh. No, I didn't mean it like that.

538
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:27,940
对不起
I'm sorry.

539
00:20:28,360 --> 00:20:30,360
你知道我有派对前焦虑症 我很紧张
You know I have party anxiety. I was nervous.

540
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,840
不 你并没有完全说错
No, but you're not entirely wrong.

541
00:20:31,840 --> 00:20:35,980
我的确可以少一些 端架子
I mean, I-I could be a little... less uptight

542
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:37,180
多放开一点
and loosen up a little bit.

543
00:20:37,280 --> 00:20:39,280
对 也许我们可以
Yeah. Maybe we could, you know,

544
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:40,840
追求中庸的乐趣
aim for middle-ground fun.

545
00:20:41,546 --> 00:20:43,560
如果你想重新庆祝下情人节
You know, if--if you're up for a do-over,

546
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:45,240
我最近听说了一种玩法
I recently heard of an idea

547
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,940
可以让我们享受下
that could put us in the low end

548
00:20:46,940 --> 00:20:49,480
比中庸稍高档次的乐趣
of upper middle-ground fun.

549
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:50,460
好的
Okay.

550
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:55,220
你相信一见钟情吗
Do you believe in love at first sight,

551
00:20:55,220 --> 00:20:57,620
还是我要再走进来一次
or should I walk in again?

552
00:21:00,423 --> 00:21:03,440
-杰 -来了 亲爱的 我的妈呀
- Jay? - Coming, honey! Oh, god.

553
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:05,740
你在这里啊 杰 我还以为你醒不来了
There you are, Jay. I thought you'd never wake up.

554
00:21:06,120 --> 00:21:07,920
我与暗恋我的女生共度的一晚
Turns out my night with my secret admirer

555
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:08,900
真是太完美了
couldn't have gone better.

556
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:11,560
我们整晚跳舞 最棒的地方就是
We danced all night. And the best part was,

557
00:21:11,560 --> 00:21:12,860
-她的眼睛... -曼尼 曼尼
- Her eyes were just... - Manny. Manny, manny--

558
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:13,760
我超级想听
Dying to hear it.

559
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:16,540
等十秒钟进来告诉我和你妈
Wait ten seconds and come in and tell both of us.

560
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:18,540
杰 怎么去了这么久
Jay, you took so long.

561
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:19,740
我还没"玩完"呢
I'm not done with you.

562
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:21,260
我也跟你"没完"
I'm not done with you, either.

563
00:21:23,680 --> 00:21:25,180
史上最棒的情人节派对
Best valentine's party ever.

564
00:21:25,180 --> 00:21:26,440
有个女生
So there's this girl--

565
00:21:26,440 --> 00:21:27,760
我还是从头开始讲吧
I should start from the beginning.

566
00:21:28,060 --> 00:21:30,470
-好吧 -先交待下故事背景
- All right. - So first a little history...
